<div class="w-[34px] h-[34px] flex justify-center items-center"></div><div class="absolute left-0 top-0 z-40 max-w-md cursor-default break-words rounded-md bg-neutral-800 px-3 py-1.5 text-center !font-open-sans text-sm text-white hidden">Copiar link <div class="absolute h-[8px] w-[8px] rotate-45 bg-neutral-800"></div></div></div></div><div id="v-0-0-10-3-0" class="secao-colapsavel layout-contain-inp" data-v-183f86e3><div class="mb-4 w-100 h-0 border-t border-neutral-200" data-v-183f86e3></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4"><div class="py-2"><div class="flex cursor-pointer gap-4"><div class="border-l-2 border-ecdt-azul-500 p-1"></div><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-700 hover:underline">Amorix: gestão de entregas com MáximaTech</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm text-neutral-500">29/06/2020</span></div></div></div></div><div class="py-2"><div class="flex cursor-pointer gap-4"><div class="border-l-2 border-ecdt-azul-500 p-1"></div><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-700 hover:underline">Amorix: gestão de entregas com MáximaTech</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm text-neutral-500">29/06/2020</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto ecdt-modal-wrapper fixed inset-0 z-[1040] flex items-start justify-center bg-black bg-opacity-50 p-4 pt-4 md:items-center md:p-6" style="display:none;"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-lg bg-white p-6 mb-4 mt-4 flex flex-col shadow-xl md:mb-0 md:mt-0"><div class="mb-4 flex flex-shrink-0 items-start justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-800"> Preview </span><div class="rounded-full border border-neutral-500 bg-transparent px-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-500" outline>BETA</div></div><button data-testid="modal-premium-fechar" type="button" aria-label="Fechar" class="rounded-full p-2 ease-in hover:bg-neutral-200 hover:bg-opacity-10 focus:bg-opacity-20"></button></div><div class="mb-6 min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto"><div class="mt-0 flex flex-col"><span class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-700">Amorix: gestão de entregas com MáximaTech</span></div><div class="mb-4"><p class="text-sm"><span class="text-sm font-normal text-neutral-500">29/06/2020</span></p></div><div><p class="text-sm font-normal leading-5 text-neutral-700">A Amorix adotou o aplicativo maxMotorista da MáximaTech para digitalizar a gestão de entregas, reduzindo as reentregas de 2,94% para 0,48%. O aplicativo melhora o acompanhamento em tempo real das entregas.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-shrink-0"><a href="https://baguete.com.br/noticias/29/06/2020/amorix-gestao-de-entregas-com-maximatech#:~:text=A Amorix, consultoria e distribuidora de insumos e equipamentos para" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-autofocus tabindex="0" class="flex gap-3 rounded-md bg-ecdt-azul-500 px-4 py-[10px] text-white transition-colors hover:bg-ecdt-azul-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ecdt-azul-300 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"> Ver notícia completa <img src="https://prd.ecdtstatic.com.br/icons/arrow-outward.svg" alt aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" loading="eager" class="brightness-0 invert"></a></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto ecdt-modal-wrapper fixed inset-0 z-[1040] flex items-start justify-center bg-black bg-opacity-50 p-4 pt-4 md:items-center md:p-6" style="display:none;"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-lg bg-white p-6 mb-4 mt-4 flex flex-col shadow-xl md:mb-0 md:mt-0"><div class="mb-4 flex flex-shrink-0 items-start justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-800"> Preview </span><div class="rounded-full border border-neutral-500 bg-transparent px-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-500" outline>BETA</div></div><button data-testid="modal-premium-fechar" type="button" aria-label="Fechar" class="rounded-full p-2 ease-in hover:bg-neutral-200 hover:bg-opacity-10 focus:bg-opacity-20"></button></div><div class="mb-6 min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto"><div class="mt-0 flex flex-col"><span class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-700">Amorix: gestão de entregas com MáximaTech</span></div><div class="mb-4"><p class="text-sm"><span class="text-sm font-normal text-neutral-500">29/06/2020</span></p></div><div><p class="text-sm font-normal leading-5 text-neutral-700">A Amorix adotou o aplicativo maxMotorista da MáximaTech para digitalizar a gestão de entregas, reduzindo as reentregas de 2,94% para 0,48%. O aplicativo melhora o acompanhamento em tempo real das entregas.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-shrink-0"><a href="https://baguete.com.br/noticias/29/06/2020/amorix-gestao-de-entregas-com-maximatech#:~:text=Agora, com o aplicativo maxMotorista, que também conta com uma" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-autofocus tabindex="0" class="flex gap-3 rounded-md bg-ecdt-azul-500 px-4 py-[10px] text-white transition-colors hover:bg-ecdt-azul-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ecdt-azul-300 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"> Ver notícia completa <img src="https://prd.ecdtstatic.com.br/icons/arrow-outward.svg" alt aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" loading="eager" class="brightness-0 invert"></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="ecdt-card-square group relative scroll-mt-28 !rounded-lg max-md:!p-4 scroll-mt-56 !rounded-xl font-open-sans" data-v-183f86e3><div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between max-md:cursor-pointer max-md:!mb-0 my-0 opacity-100" data-v-183f86e3><div class="mr-2 !h-6 !w-6 justify-center flex flex-shrink-0 items-center" data-v-183f86e3><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center" data-v-183f86e3><img src="https://prd.ecdtstatic.com.br/icons/diamond.svg" alt aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" loading="eager" class="svg-verde-600" data-v-183f86e3></span></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col" data-v-183f86e3><div clas